          "Key": "Row6_TextContent_FromRoleId107",
          "SourceString": "本人玛德蕾娜，很荣幸与引航者一起负责活动现场的布置与设备调试。",
          "LocalizedString": "I, Maddelena, am honored to be given responsibility for the event's layout and equipment together with the Navigator."
